  "bodyHash": "GKWMkmE6kI4=",
  "content": "<h3><span style=\"color:#fff\">是<a style=\"color:#fff\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sgjourney\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>星际之门之旅</strong></a>的扩展模组，它将<strong>星际之门</strong>的生成扩展到其他模组的维度，并为部分<strong>科技模组</strong>添加兼容性合成配方。</span></h3><p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>星际之门生成</strong>覆盖以下多种维度：</span></p><ol>\n<li>\n<p><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">天境</a></strong></span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><a style=\"color:#236fa1\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ad-astra\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Ad Astra（所有维度）</strong></a></span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><a style=\"color:#f1c40f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cosmic-horizons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>宇宙视界（所有维度）</strong></a></span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span style=\"color:#169179\"><a style=\"color:#169179\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-twilight-forest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>暮色森林</strong></a></span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><a style=\"color:#236fa1\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deeperdarker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>更深更暗</strong></a></span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/official-divinerpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\">神圣RPG（所有维度）</span></strong></a></span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-undergarden\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>地下花园</strong></a></span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/eternal-starlight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>永恒星光（1.21.1）</strong></span></a></span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dive-into-the-abyss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\">深渊潜航（1.21.1）</span></strong></a><br></span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/blue-skies/files/all?page=1&amp;pageSize=20\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">蓝色天空（1.20.1）</a></strong></span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><a style=\"color:#236fa1\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-afterdark\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">暗夜之后</a></span></strong></span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<h4><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/star-wars-planets-ad-astra\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">星球大战行星（Ad Astra）</span></a><br><br></strong></span></span></h4>\n</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stellaris\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">群星（1.21.1）</a><br><br><span style=\"color:#fff\">下界与末地传送门畅通无阻！</span></strong></span><span style=\"color:#fff\">&nbsp;<br><br></span></span></li>\n</ol><p>✔ <span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>为以下模组提供兼容性配方：</strong></span></p><ol>\n<li><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong><a style=\"color:#e67e23\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">⚙ 机械动力</a></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#fd668e\"><a style=\"color:#fd668e\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tinkers-construct\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>🛠 匠魂</strong></a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><a style=\"color:#f1c40f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/thermal-expansion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>🔥 热力膨胀</strong></a><br><br><strong><span style=\"color:#fff\">必需前置：</span></strong><span style=\"color:#fff\"> <strong><a style=\"color:#fff\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sgjourney\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">星际之门之旅</a></strong></span><br>🔹 <span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>兼容版本：</strong> <strong>Minecraft 1.20.1, 1.21.1<br><br></strong></span></span></li>\n</ol>\n\n（注：根据用户要求，已移除原始内容末尾的葡萄牙语部分，仅保留中文翻译内容。所有超链接及样式代码均完整保留，模组名称采用中文社区常用译名，维度描述保持与原文一致的技术准确性。）",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
